  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Subnet.Interaction.InspectableObject
  inspectionId: Laptop
  firstInspection:
  - Your laptop. Seventeen unread emails. The subject lines all sound like sighs.
  - '* The desk under it wobbles when you think too hard. You assembled it with the
    wrong screws.'
  repeatInspection:
  - Closing the lid doesn't make them go away. But it helps.
