  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: eaca2b573c63c41189c8f5980d410ea1, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Subnet.Interaction.InspectableObject
  inspectionId: Handheld
  firstInspection:
  - Your handheld. You modded it yourself, back when you still had weekends.
  - It's lying on box fourteen. The last box. The lightest, and somehow the hardest
    to open.
  - 'One new message. No sender. It just says: <color=#33FFF2>''last train leaves
    at 00:00. platform zero. don''t miss it.''</color>'
  - '* There''s no platform zero at Central Station. ...Is there?'
  - '* (Now I can leave through the front door.)'
  repeatInspection:
  - The message is still there. The clock on the screen says 23:51. The door is that
    way.
