  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: eaca2b573c63c41189c8f5980d410ea1, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Subnet.Interaction.InspectableObject
  inspectionId: Radio
  firstInspection:
  - A radio stuck between stations. A weather report, a love song, and a sound like
    breathing, all at once.
  - '* It sits on a box labeled ''MISC''. That''s what you write when you don''t
